;; gather (FEAT-018 S-B) — fan-in: await each handle, collect results.
;;
;; The join half of the fan-out. Takes the handle list `scatter` returned and
;; awaits each (await-session), collecting the results in order. A crashed child
;; yields its {"err" ...} map in place rather than aborting the gather (errors are
;; data — the caller folds over them).
;;
;; Args (data/*):
;;   handles — the list of mission handles from scatter (required).
;;
;; Returns [result ...] — one awaited result per handle, in order.
(map (fn [h] (tool/await-session {:handle h})) data/handles)
